entitled to cast.

\medskip

\noindent
I hereby grant my said attorney-in-fact and agent full power and authority to act for me, and in
my name, at said meeting or meetings, in the transaction of any business which may come before the
meeting, as fully as I could do if personally present, all in accordance with the Association's
governing documents and applicable
{% if association.state %}{{ association.state | upper }}{% else %}state{% endif %}
